==Trivia==
[[Kyoko Umemoto]] illustrated both a {{TCG ID|EX Crystal Guardians|Diglett|50}} card and a {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Dugtrio|93}} card for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]; though the cards did not originally release together in the TCG—being released in 2006 and 2020 respectively—their illustrations were later included alongside each other in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket's {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion. {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Dugtrio|34}}'s illustration references the Diglett from this card's illustration in its background.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Crystal Guardians|Diglett|50}} from the {{TCG|EX Crystal Guardians}} expansion.
*'''Slight Intrusion''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Roaring Skies|Nincada|9}} from the {{TCG|Roaring Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

